EVB Viewer fork notice

This distribution is a modified fork of Mozilla's PDF.js version 5.7.284.
The fork source repository is https://github.com/evb0110/pdf.js.git.
The upstream PDF.js license and notices remain in LICENSE and in the bundled
component license files. THIRD_PARTY_INVENTORY.json lists bundled components
and the license files shipped with them.

This fork does not authorize or perform npm publication. The generated package
name is pdfjs-dist for compatibility with existing PDF.js consumers.

EVB Viewer additionally consumes immutable native FreeText appearance PDFs as
read-only render resources. PDF.js does not edit or save those annotations.

EVB Viewer can render offscreen display rasters without animation callbacks,
preserving display content while the browser tab is hidden.
